 it differs from prior failed fixes that attempted to restructure let-bindings or block scope rather than directly correcting the quantifier chaining.\n\n[LESSON]:\nWhen chaining multiple quantifiers in Alloy, always join them with logical operators (&&, ||, =>) to create valid Boolean formulas; Alloy does not allow bare quantifier statements to appear in sequence.\n```",
